  "Uses about $0.15 of Meta credit and needs the execution code. Without independent evidence the answer is often needs more info. A run that fails the schema still costs and replaces the earlier triage. Runs per day are capped in the admin panel.":
    "Memakai sekitar $0,15 kredit Meta dan butuh kode eksekusi. Tanpa bukti independen, jawabannya sering butuh info tambahan. Run yang gagal skema tetap berbiaya dan menimpa triase sebelumnya. Jumlah run per hari dibatasi di panel admin.",
  "Pair checked in the last {h} hours; showing it.": "Pasangan sudah dicek dalam {h} jam terakhir; ditampilkan.",
  "No pair yet: Sentinel-2 has not passed over this area since the first detection. It passes about every 2 to 5 days; try again after the next pass.":
    "Belum ada pasangan: Sentinel-2 belum melintasi area ini sejak deteksi pertama. Satelit lewat sekitar setiap 2 sampai 5 hari; coba lagi setelah lintasan berikutnya.",
  "No pair yet: the after image is missing. {n} pass(es) since the first detection, none at least 60% clear over the area (clouds or smoke). Try again after the next pass, about every 2 to 5 days.":
    "Belum ada pasangan: citra sesudah belum ada. {n} lintasan sejak deteksi pertama, tidak ada yang minimal 60% cerah di area ini (awan atau asap). Coba lagi setelah lintasan berikutnya, sekitar setiap 2 sampai 5 hari.",
  "No pair: the before image is missing. No pass in the 120 days before the first detection is at least 60% clear over the area ({n} checked).":
    "Tidak ada pasangan: citra sebelum tidak ada. Tidak ada lintasan dalam 120 hari sebelum deteksi pertama yang minimal 60% cerah di area ini ({n} dicek).",
  "Sentinel-2 pair stored as {id}.": "Pasangan Sentinel-2 disimpan sebagai {id}.", "No pair: {why}": "Tidak ada pasangan: {why}", "Sentinel-2 failed: {e}": "Sentinel-2 gagal: {e}",
  "NASA FIRMS satellite hotspots (VIIRS and MODIS), fetched every 30 minutes.": "Titik panas satelit NASA FIRMS (VIIRS dan MODIS), diambil setiap 30 menit.",
  "NASA GIBS satellite layers for the map, checked from this browser.": "Lapisan citra satelit NASA GIBS untuk peta, dicek dari browser ini.",
  "Wind, humidity, and rain evidence for each incident.": "Bukti angin, kelembapan, dan hujan untuk setiap insiden.",
  "Nearby settlements, roads, and water from OpenStreetMap (Overpass).": "Permukiman, jalan, dan perairan terdekat dari OpenStreetMap (Overpass).",
  "Offline copy": "Salinan offline",
  "On": "Aktif", "Down": "Gangguan", "Simulation": "Simulasi", "Not checked": "Belum dicek",
